@startuml 03-token-lifecycle
' TokenRealty — Token Lifecycle (8 steps)
' Render: plantuml docs/diagrams/03-token-lifecycle.puml

title TokenRealty — Token Lifecycle

skinparam shadowing false

|Property Registry|
start
:Flat registered\n(status: AVAILABLE);
:SPV registered for building;
:SPV KYC verified;

|Token Issuance|
:POST /v1/tokens\n(deploy PropertyToken.sol);
note right: **Blocked today:**\nempty Solidity contracts

|Property Registry|
:PATCH /v1/flats/{id}/token-info\n(flat → TOKENIZED);
:Building → TOKENIZED;

|Compliance Service|
:Investors registered;
:KYC verified + whitelisted;

|Token Issuance|
:PATCH /v1/tokens/{id}/enable-transfers\n(trading opens);

|Marketplace|
:Listing created for flat;

|Investor|
:Browse listings;
:Buy tokens (see sell-flow diagram);

|Token Issuance|
:POST /v1/tokens/{id}/transfers\n(token transfer on-chain);

|Property Registry|
if (All tokens sold?) then (yes)
  :Flat → FULLY_SOLD;
else (no)
  :Flat remains TOKENIZED;
endif

|Rental Service|
:Rent collected (see rent-flow diagram);

|Token Issuance|
:POST /v1/tokens/{id}/dividends/distribute\n(pro-rata to holders);

stop

@enduml
